<h1>mean</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
The (arithmetic) mean of some values is the sum of all values divided by the number of values.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="median.html"><em>median</em></a>, <a href="mode.html"><em>mode</em></a>, <a href="midrange.html"><em>midrange</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
The mean of 1, 1, 3, 50, and 60 is 23. (1 + 1 + 3 + 50 + 60) / 5 = 23.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

